verie wearing a maid outfit and smoking a cigarette, in the style that you used for your Sakamata Chloe smoking a pipe (https://www.pixiv.net/en/artworks/95448886).  You decide the pose for the illustration.\n\nFor Ophelia's expression I wanted it to be like in this illustration https://www.pixiv.net/en/artworks/84571626\n\nI would like to request if the maid outfit be in the colour of Ophelia's clothes/costume.\nThe reference sheet for Ophelia Midnight can be found in her twitter page (newest model) https://twitter.com/OpheliaVReverie/status/1598366667683221504?s=20&t=15Bl_GopFXjAhyf1YSNUjQ.\n\nThank you very much for considering my request", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@zeiss_ss/works/4", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/a4913615/uploads/origins/f45cc230-7b3c-409d-9d73-328c4226297a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=cf189b76450323bdfe0195863a1ee9bb", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a4913615/uploads/origins/f45cc230-7b3c-409d-9d73-328c4226297a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=cf189b76450323bdfe0195863a1ee9bb, https://si.imgix.net/a4913615/uploads/origins/f45cc230-7b3c-409d-9d73-328c4226297a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=2572051a2cae3665c59fb1dbec66de15 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a4913615/uploads/origins/f45cc230-7b3c-409d-9d73-328c4226297a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=160cb13f4424b7ac7a3f356632175fe1 3x"}, "private": true, "genr